.env

# 3D/이미지 원본 — 빌드에는 최적화본만 쓴다 (public/models/*.glb, src/assets/pc-screen.webp).
# 원본은 각자 로컬에 두고, 필요할 때 npm run models 로 다시 굽는다.
src/assets/*.glb
src/assets/image.png
src/assets/image2.png
src/assets/*.jpeg
# 칩 라벨 원본(4K PNG) — 커밋되는 것은 같은 이름의 .webp
public/images/chips/*.png
public/images/boxes/*.png
ascii.txt

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# generated gallery thumbnails (rebuilt by scripts/generate-gallery.mjs)
public/images/thumbs

# build-time outputs of scripts/generate-*.mjs (rebuilt on every npm run dev/build)
public/data/gallery.json
public/data/au-gallery.json
public/data/posts.json
public/data/au-posts.json
